        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emy rosa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105454731941331873746/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPt17ekHlQ1jPtgE8_GEqRutpBtPxctpMP2AZ01Mk3hBIY4qJv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I took the water process engineering course at this training center and I don't think it deserves even one star. There are some professors who show favoritism, and you can feel the racism just because you don't come from the same country... As for the lab technicians, there's ONE female lab technician who intimidates the students a lot, but nobody dares to speak up or say a word. I hope the administration reads my message and takes action for the sake of future students... In short, a bad experience.",
        "time": 1577056090,
        "translated": true
      },
